11:["$","p",null,{"children":"Through our Reconnaissance Licence RL-003, we hold a 35% participating interest across Blocks LB-26, LB-30, and LB-31—encompassing 8,924 km² (approximately 2.2 million acres). Exploration operations are conducted in formal partnership with TotalEnergies, who serves as operator with a 65% interest. All exploration expenditures incurred under the reconnaissance licence framework are recoverable upon conversion to production sharing agreements."}]
